40
00:05:12,403 --> 00:05:15,067
[Host] It means a phase or situation.

41
00:05:15,668 --> 00:05:26,180
[Slow] 変動金利で住宅ローンを借りている人は、毎月の返済額が増える可能性があります。

42
00:05:26,980 --> 00:05:31,779
[Host] People with variable-rate mortgages may see their monthly repayments go up.

43
